From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Thibaut Lapierre <root@epheo.eu>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 01:08:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 16/16] etcd: vendor the patched microshift packages

microshift-etcd builds against its own vendored copy of MicroShift's
pkg/config and pkg/util, which the series' changes did not reach. With
the node IP on br-ex, the stale copy skipped br-ex when no default route
existed, found no address and exited, so MicroShift never started on an
isolated network. Regenerated with go mod vendor in etcd/; rerun it last
whenever a patch changes those packages.
---
